## 🛠️ Herramientas Útiles

### 📊 Analizador de Imports
Crear un script para validar imports:

```dart
void validateImports(String filePath) {
  final content = File(filePath).readAsStringSync();
  final lines = content.split('\n');
  
  for (final line in lines) {
    if (line.trim().startsWith('import')) {
      if (line.contains('package:maps_app/')) {
        print('❌ Package import found in $filePath: $line');
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### 🔍 Linter Rules
Configurar reglas en `analysis_options.yaml`:

```yaml
analyzer:
  rules:
    - prefer_relative_imports
    - directives_ordering
    - sort_pub_dependencies
```
